# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Defeat Nek'rosh (474), Sully Balloo's Letter (637), Ironband Wants You! (707), Sara Balloo's Plea (683),
# The Thandol Span (632, 633), Plea to the Alliance (634, handed in at Refuge Pointe in 05-arathi-highlands) and, on the
# Defeat Nek'rosh group branch, This Land Was Their Land (98230), which Captain Stoutfist offers only after 474 is handed in (#1299),
# with Howin's Word to Ironforge (98300, optional: never seen offered without 98230) on the same stop. Solo players never see
# them (when group 474).
# Spark of Freedom (87491) is a group quest (#1313): its escort starts at the far west of Dun Modr's elite Dark Iron ruins.
# MacKreel's Moonshine (647) is taken in 05-arathi-highlands: its 15-minute limit does not last the walk to Menethil and the boat (#1319).

step To Deepwater Tavern
  zone Wetlands
  goto 10.7,61.0 "Deepwater Tavern"

step Angerfang Encampment
  tip South-east from Menethil to the Dragonmaw's Angerfang Encampment: the first catapult stands on the way, and the Tattered Spellbook lies in the camp.
  turnin 465                          -- Dragonmaw Catapult

step Angerfang Encampment
  when group 474
  accept 474

step Angerfang Encampment
  note The next step, Defeat Nek'rosh, pits you against an elite chieftain: skip it.
  accept 98223 object 671518          -- Tattered Spellbook: for Captain Stoutfist

step Defeat Nek'rosh
  when group 474
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chieftain Nek'rosh is a level 32 elite: most classes solo it at level 34, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Shadowcasters stand on either side of him, and at least one is linked to him, so it joins when he is pulled. Non-elite centurions and captains are spread around his ring of tents.
  collect 3625 quest 474.1 @53.5,54.7 map 1437

step Golm
  when group 98310
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Golm, Ados, Neru and Modr are level 32 elites, each called up by using the Goaz Stone beside it. Skip them if you are alone. Golm stands in the south-eastern hills.
  collect 280397 quest 98310.3        -- Heart of Golm

step Ados
  when group 98310
  tip North-east to the Dragonmaw Gates: Ados stands at the gates (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280395 quest 98310.1        -- Heart of Ados

step Dragonmaw Gates: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip The whelps nest in the hills north-east of the Angerfang Encampment; Carnage prowls further north, and the Razormaw raptors hunt the highlands on the way north to Dun Modr.
  tip Carnage is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 279385 quest 98072.1        -- Pristine Crimson Scale
  collect 280330 quest 98283.2 optional -- Carnage's Head
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1        -- Razormaw Incisor

step Razormaw nests
  when onquest 98246
  tip The Perfect Razormaw Eggs for Trying Times lie in the raptors' nests in the hills around Carnage.
  collect 280132 quest 98246.1 @69.2,32.7 -- Perfect Razormaw Egg

step Neru
  when group 98310
  tip Neru stands in the hills between the Dragonmaw Gates and Dun Modr (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280398 quest 98310.4        -- Heart of Neru

step The Green Belt
  when has 280330
  tip Maddened Rotclaws roam the Green Belt around Rethiel; one of them drops the flesh. Rethiel takes the quest only with Carnage's head too.
  collect 280331 quest 98283.1        -- Malignant Rotclaw Flesh

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  when complete 98283
  turnin 98283                        -- With Carnage's head and the flesh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dun Modr

step Dun Modr
  tip North along the road to Dun Modr. Longbraid the Grim and Rhag Garmason stand together in the dwarves' camp on the east side of the road; the Dark Iron ruins west of it are full of elites.
  turnin 472                              -- Longbraid the Grim
  accept 631                          -- Rhag Garmason

step Captive Fire Elemental
  when group 87491
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. The Captive Fire Elemental is held at the far west end of the Dark Iron ruins, past level 27-30 elite dwarves, and Balgaras the Foul (34, elite) can be among them. Lead it east out of the ruins, then hand it in to Roggo Harlbarrow in the camp. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 87491                        -- Captive Fire Elemental
  turnin 87491                        -- Roggo Harlbarrow

step Modr
  when group 98310
  tip Modr stands in the ruins of Dun Modr (use the Goaz Stone).
  collect 280396 quest 98310.2        -- Heart of Modr

step The Villards
  zone Wetlands
  tip Corma Villard waits on the road north of Dun Modr, towards the Thandol Span; Essene a short walk further north-east, and Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse lies under the span beside her. Rustlocke's parchment goes back to Rhag.
  tip Corma Villard may not offer Hearts of the Lost yet: if she doesn't, skip it.
  tip Two elite Dark Iron Saboteurs stand by the corpse inside the span: pull them one at a time, or loot the corpse and run out.
  accept 87318 optional               -- Corma Villard
  turnin 87318 optional               -- Essene Villard
  turnin 631                          -- Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse, inside
  accept 632                          -- the same corpse

step Rhag Garmason
  zone Wetlands
  tip Back down the road to Dun Modr: Rhag wants the Dark Iron explosives under the far end of the span destroyed.
  turnin 632                          -- Rhag Garmason
  accept 633

step The Cache of Explosives
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Over the Thandol Span: the Dark Irons' cache of explosives sits by its Arathi end.
  interact 2704 quest 633.1           -- Cache of Explosives

