# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier into town: Phin Odelic and Lieutenant Farren stand by the inn, Chef Jessen upstairs, Darren Malvew east of it; the flight master is at the north end, Micha Yance and Bartolo Ginsetti between her and the inn, Maleb in the town hall at the west side.
  tip Barkeep Kelly may not offer Talk of the Town on Forever: if she doesn't, skip it.
  # An Alarming Request requires level 30 (Forever's quest data, quest 92432, checked 2026-10-14).
  accept 659                          -- Phin Odelic: his trail leads to Arathi
  turnin 98219 npc 2228               -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, inside
  accept 536                          -- Lieutenant Farren Orinelle
  sethome "Southshore" npc 2352       -- Innkeeper Anderson
  accept 98463 optional               -- Barkeep Kelly, in the inn: for Booty Bay (04-stranglethorn-vale)
  accept 555                          -- Chef Jessen, upstairs
  accept 564                          -- Darren Malvew: the lions come later
  getfp "Southshore" npc 2432         -- Darla Harris
  buy 3713 x1 npc 2381                -- Soothing Spices, from Micha Yance
  accept 505                          -- Magistrate Henry Maleb, inside
  accept 92432 "An Alarming Request" npc 247264 lvl 30 -- Emissary Jacques

step Bartolo Ginsetti
  when has 3719
  when has 2997
  tip Bartolo makes a yeti fur cloak for anyone who brings a Hillman's Cloak (Leatherworking) and a Bolt of Woolen Cloth (Tailoring); no vendor sells either, so this step shows only when you carry both.
  accept 565 optional                 -- Bartolo Ginsetti, between the flight master and the inn: he wants a Hillman's Cloak and a Bolt of Woolen Cloth too

